<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Superconductor cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Superconductor cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co LLC said on Friday it lowered its rating on the shares of Illinois Superconductor Corp to hold from strong buy, after the company posted weaker-than-expected results.</p>
<p>-- Illinois Superconductor posted a loss of $0.63 per share in its second quarter compared to a loss of $0.53 per share in the year-ago second quarter.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Near-term market rollout issues have sufficiently concerned us that we are reducing the rating...,&quot; the firm said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 3/4 to 8-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
